Package: taxRmatic
Title: Generate Taxonomic Treatments from Tabular Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Jeremy", "Wilson", email = "jeremydwilson91@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools for assembling taxonomic treatments from tabular datasets.
    Supports character-state descriptions, iterative comparative diagnoses,
    material examined, figure references and captions, and user-written
    sections. Compiles sections into formatted manuscript text with flexible
    taxon ordering and heading presentation, and can export Markdown or Word
    documents.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
